<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30730" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδωδή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>food, meat, victuals</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				19.167
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.70
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Hier.</u>
				1.19
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. καὶ πόσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					782e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				350a
			</span></i>, al.: pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν . . περὶ ἐδωδὰς
				ἡδονῶν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				389e
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				519b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>forage, fodder</i> for cattle, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.504
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>bait</i> for fish, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				21.43
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>act of eating</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδόντας ἔχει . . ἐδωδῆς χάριν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					683a4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ ἐ. τοῦ βοὸς
				[χαίρε&lt;&gt;] ὁ λέων</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>EN</u>
				1118a20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πουλύποδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					6.181a
				</span></i>
			, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>meal</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ μιᾶς ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					596a4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀετὸς] ἀχθόμενος τῇ ἐ.</span> wearied
			with <i>feeding</i> the young birds, ib.<i><span class="en">
				563a22
			</span></i>.</div>
